      "sourceTextSha256": "97eaa4226e006ce56eb5efd595f2d7da84d85c0e08b42bbf972163fb1be58d03",
      "text": "Early in the morning, drive to Bonito, visiting the Estância Mimosa on the way. After a warm welcome at the main ranch house, set off on a walk through the forest along the Mimosa River, past ten beautiful waterfalls where you can stop to admire the rock formations or swim; there is also a deep natural pool with a 5-metre jumping platform, and trails and viewpoints inside the forest along the river.\n\nAfter the hike, you can order lunch at the main house (optional) and relax in the hammocks before continuing to Bonito.",
